  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Novel Cornoavirus Disease (COVID-19) WHO Joint Reponse Plan India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support India&#x2019;s preparedness and response operations to contain the COVID-19 outbreak in India, halt the local spread and mitigate impact of the outbreak. Cooperation among health partners to facilitate strategic planning with oranisational leadership and accountability in a framework for effective partnerships in alignement with India&apos;s Ministry of Health&#x2019;s Cluster Containment and Mitigation Plans. Technical guidance and facilitation of linkages among stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
